"The Night Order corrupts monsters on purpose and gathers blightstones for its lord."
"The Night Order sealed Renir because he found out it was corrupting monsters."
"Order mages tainted the Sunpeak necklace forty years ago while praying at its shrine."
"The blight dungeon's core was a Divine bracelet of four elements, turned black."
"The Order's island lab dumped blight slabs into the southern sea; it now lies sunk."
"The lab bred living ichor; purified, it left behind a small orb no one yet understands."
"Corruption is dark magic; the Order calls it 'just the efficient way to reach our goal'."
"If the Order won a Divine water glimmercore, the whole ocean might become a blight dungeon."
